    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #308\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-112-module-contract-06-12-detect-live-mech-thr_8e3etcjz8r`.\n\n## Summary\n\nFixed the CI failure on PR #308: a migration ordinal collision, since `develop` had meanwhile merged issue #111's real implementation with its own `0011_module_data_migrations.sql` while this branch's `0011_finding_resolution.sql` was in flight. Renamed this branch's migration to `0012_finding_resolution.sql`.\n\nWhile preparing to push, I found the remote branch had also received an independent `develop` merge commit (pushed by another automated process on this same thread) after my local merge — reconciled by merging that remote state into my local branch (clean, no conflicts) before pushing.\n\nVerified before push:\n- Backend build — all 7 workspace packages compile.\n- `check-migration-numbering` — 12 files, all unique ordinals.\n- Backend full test suite — all tests pass (exit code 0).\n- Web build and test suite — passing (verified in the prior turn against the same merged state).\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
